    "detailed_description": "Meet Lewis.  A washed up salesman who finds himself stranded in a strange forbidding town.  Lewis has always been ordinary.  He's never been a hero; he's never been a fighter.  He's never had to survive.  Life has been easy for Lewis.  But all that is about to change.  Lewis must face his deepest fears, conquer his worst nightmares, and become something far MORE than he ever thought possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/73ed872685980eb2700884e67e80342a.avif?t=1740532685\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/4fd21efc09f2d6e59dca99aba9cc4b4e.poster.avif?t=1740532685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/4fd21efc09f2d6e59dca99aba9cc4b4e.webm?t=1740532685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/4fd21efc09f2d6e59dca99aba9cc4b4e.mp4?t=1740532685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore a large pixel art city, scavenging for food, parts and weapons.  Each playthrough has a randomized map for a unique experience every time.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/c834fbdbfd07ce5bd19fe481b2259756.avif?t=1740532685\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/abf7ec9db7b6153bb98521830127e4e3.poster.avif?t=1740532685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154490/extras/abf7ec9db7b6153bb98521830127e4e3.webm?t=1740532685\" type=\"video/webm; co